Credits
=======

Final Quest 8
-------------

Game design, cards, classes, balance, illustrations and card layout: lyrkhan.


Systems and modules
-------------------

  - Foundry VTT dnd5e system
  - D&D 5th edition SRD 5.1, used under CC BY 4.0
  - socketlib, lib-wrapper, DAE                 required dependencies
  - Sequencer, JB2A, Dice So Nice               optional dependencies

These modules are downloaded by the user from their own sources. None of their
assets are redistributed in this package.


Asset sources
-------------

Card illustrations, class art and tokens come from royalty-free sources or are
AI-generated. Their selection, composition, card layout and integration into
Final Quest 8 are the work of lyrkhan.

Sound effects are original to this project (see RELEASE 2.0.0).

Visual effects in visuals/ are rendered for this project. They are played through
the optional Sequencer module; no JB2A asset is redistributed here.
